# Formspree endpoint for the "Join the Waitlist" form.
# 1. Sign up at https://formspree.io with the email you want submissions sent to.
# 2. Create a new form (e.g. "Waitlist Signups") and verify your email address.
# 3. Copy the form endpoint from the Formspree dashboard (looks like https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx).
# 4. Copy this file to .env and paste your real endpoint below, then restart `npm run dev`.
VITE_FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/YOUR_FORM_ID
